WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[Playful music, birds, and children in the park]

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
[A local train arrives; a soft door chime]

00:16.700 --> 00:19.700
[A descending whistle, a soft boing, and rustling leaves]

00:20.000 --> 00:35.000
[Pattering paws, gusts of wind, and swirling leaves]

00:35.000 --> 00:45.000
[The music softens for movie night]

00:47.250 --> 00:49.300
[A comic tire-screech and sudden stop]

00:50.200 --> 00:53.500
[Surprised gasps and popcorn scattering]

00:55.000 --> 01:00.000
[The dog pants; a playful musical finish]
